# One-off investigation artefacts: scratch transcripts and probe scripts stay
# local, same convention as the scripts/_*.py probes.
episodes/_scratch_*
scripts/_*.py
audio/_*
data/_*
# Never commit credentials. `git add -A` swept scratch logs into this repo once
# already (removed in c765c6d), so the filenames a key is most likely to land in
# are blocked by name rather than left to discipline.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*credentials*.json
*secret*.json
*token*.json
apikey*
api_key*
.netrc
